# Airbender Ascension: "When this enchantment enters, airbend up to one target creature." The target may be any creature, an
# opponent's too (CR 701.65a). Bot2's Hero of Bladehold is exiled; its owner may cast it from exile for {2} rather than its
# mana cost {2}{W}{W} - Bot2 taps only two of its four mana sources (Plains and Mox Pearl: no second {W} for the printed cost)
# and the cast goes through. Hero entering under Bot2's control is not "a creature you control" for Bot1, so no quest counter;
# Bot1's own Ornithopter two turns later is, so the enchantment ends with exactly one.

